        "y1": 0.22629408402876416
      },
      "text": ",",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000172534020118,
        "y0": 0.22943901293205493,
        "x1": 0.7173463410022212,
        "y1": 0.24453396267361116
      },
      "text": "the corresponding warped system is quasi-isometric to an expander.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17869289871913935,
        "y0": 0.24767889157690182,
        "x1": 0.8492585350485409,
        "y1": 0.26277384131845805
      },
      "text": "In [WY12, WY14], Willett and Yu introduced a coarse invariance for metrics",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000172534020118,
        "y0": 0.2659187702217487,
        "x1": 0.8492441613689746,
        "y1": 0.28101371996330493
      },
      "text": "spaces, so called geometric property (T), which is an obstruction to the surjectivity",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000172534020118,
        "y0": 0.2841586488665957,
        "x1": 0.5991812811957465,
        "y1": 0.2992535986081518
      },
      "text": "of the maximal coarse Baum-Connes assembly map.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6145941042432598,
        "y0": 0.2841586488665957,
        "x1": 0.8493028029896854,
        "y1": 0.2992535986081518
      },
      "text": "Roughly speaking, it is the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000172534020118,
        "y0": 0.3023972944779829,
        "x1": 0.8492831560521344,
        "y1": 0.31749224421953914
      },
      "text": "existence of spectral gap for the Laplacian in the maximal Roe algebra associated",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000172534020118,
        "y0": 0.3206371731228299,
        "x1": 0.8492441613689746,
        "y1": 0.33573212286438603
      },
      "text": "with the space. So, for a coarse disjoint union of finite graphs, it is stronger than",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000172534020118,
        "y0": 0.33887709029997237,
        "x1": 0.849224813623366,
        "y1": 0.3539720400415286
      },
      "text": "being an expander in the sense that the Laplacian has spectral gap in the Roe algebra.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000172534020118,
        "y0": 0.35711700747711494,
        "x1": 0.4325898114372702,
        "y1": 0.37221195721867106
      },
      "text": "They showed that for a box space",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.43910137500638274,
        "y0": 0.35711700747711494,
        "x1": 0.4549634846207363,
        "y1": 0.37221195721867106
      },
      "text": "X",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.46279747657526554,
        "y0": 0.35711700747711494,
        "x1": 0.5480661828533496,
        "y1": 0.37221195721867106
      },
      "text": "of a group",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5544314914279513,
        "y0": 0.35711700747711494,
        "x1": 0.5695122114193985,
        "y1": 0.37221195721867106
      },
      "text": "G",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.569518095527599,
        "y0": 0.35711700747711494,
        "x1": 0.5748119977564593,
        "y1": 0.37221195721867106
      },
      "text": ",",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5811341229607078,
        "y0": 0.35711700747711494,
        "x1": 0.5969962325750613,
        "y1": 0.37221195721867106
      },
      "text": "X",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.60483182021995,
        "y0": 0.35711700747711494,
        "x1": 0.849737628612643,
        "y1": 0.37221195721867106
      },
      "text": "has geometric property (T) if",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1500017752055249,
        "y0": 0.3753569246542574,
        "x1": 0.24019323610791973,
        "y1": 0.39045187439581364
      },
      "text": "and only if",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24667824639214408,
        "y0": 0.3753569246542574,
        "x1": 0.2617589913162531,
        "y1": 0.39045187439581364
      },
      "text": "G",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.26814065571703943,
        "y0": 0.3753569246542574,
        "x1": 0.4141620810514961,
        "y1": 0.39045187439581364
      },
      "text": "has property (T).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17869293611813214,
        "y0": 0.3935968418314,
        "x1": 0.8493367114098244,
        "y1": 0.4086917915729561
      },
      "text": "In [WY14], geometric property (T) was defined for discrete metric spaces, but",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.150001762739194,
        "y0": 0.4118354874427872,
        "x1": 0.8492832433164509,
        "y1": 0.4269304371843434
      },
      "text": "to study it for warped systems, we adopt the non-discrete analogue formulated in",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.150001762739194,
        "y0": 0.43007540461992977,
        "x1": 0.6725144105799058,
        "y1": 0.445170354361486
      },
      "text": "[Win21]. If the base space is a compact Riemannian manifold",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6801030776079964,
        "y0": 0.43007540461992977,
        "x1": 0.6986023647333283,
        "y1": 0.445170354361486
      },
      "text": "M",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7076814938214869,
        "y0": 0.43007540461992977,
        "x1": 0.8498350654552186,
        "y1": 0.445170354361486
      },
      "text": "and the action is",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1500017752055249,
        "y0": 0.44831532179707223,
        "x1": 0.8492052664164624,
        "y1": 0.46341027153862846
      },
      "text": "Lipschitz, the associated warped cone can be approximated by a graph with uniformly",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1500017752055249,
        "y0": 0.4665552389742148,
        "x1": 0.8493223501965891,
        "y1": 0.48165018871577103
      },
      "text": "bounded degree as Lemma 2.7 and Lemma 2.8. Geometric property (T) in the sense",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1500017752055249,
        "y0": 0.4847951561513574,
        "x1": 0.8492246141620711,
        "y1": 0.4998901058929135
      },
      "text": "of [Win21] is equivalent to the geometric property (T) of its discretization in the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1500017752055249,
        "y0": 0.5030350733284998,
        "x1": 0.8312335045509089,
        "y1": 0.5181300230700561
      },
      "text": "sense of [WY14]. In [Win21, Question 11.2], Winkel asked the following question:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1500017752055249,
        "y0": 0.5329024960296322,
        "x1": 0.2782467112821691,
        "y1": 0.5479974457711885
      },
      "text": "Question 1.1.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.28720930510876225,
        "y0": 0.5329024960296322,
        "x1": 0.5050092210956648,
        "y1": 0.5479974457711885
      },
      "text": "If G has property (T), M",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5151814978107129,
        "y0": 0.5329024960296322,
        "x1": 0.8494777305453431,
        "y1": 0.5479974457711885
      },
      "text": "is a compact Riemannian manifold and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000175027286305,
        "y0": 0.5511424132067748,
        "x1": 0.16508249519697202,
        "y1": 0.566237362948331
      },
      "text": "G",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1721586090287352,
        "y0": 0.5511424132067748,
        "x1": 0.1916932498707491,
        "y1": 0.566237362948331
      },
      "text": "↷",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.198761547313017,
        "y0": 0.5511424132067748,
        "x1": 0.21726084690467984,
        "y1": 0.566237362948331
      },
      "text": "M",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2270295136894276,
        "y0": 0.5511424132067748,
        "x1": 0.8489732679977916,
        "y1": 0.566237362948331
      },
      "text": "is an ergodic action by diffeomorphisms, then does the warped system has",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000173780653211,
        "y0": 0.5693823303839173,
        "x1": 0.35009506325316586,
        "y1": 0.5844772801254735
      },
      "text": "geometric property (T)?",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1786929111854703,
        "y0": 0.5992497530850498,
        "x1": 0.8492976419286791,
        "y1": 0.6143447028266059
      },
      "text": "In this paper, we provide a negative answer to the question. The following is the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000173780653211,
        "y0": 0.6174896702621923,
        "x1": 0.24982375101326337,
        "y1": 0.6325846200037484
      },
      "text": "main result.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000173780653211,
        "y0": 0.6473570929633247,
        "x1": 0.31320128098032834,
        "y1": 0.6624520427048808
      },
      "text": "Theorem 1.2. Let",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3195507822473065,
        "y0": 0.6473570929633247,
        "x1": 0.3346315271714154,
        "y1": 0.6624520427048808
      },
      "text": "G",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3409592871572457,
        "y0": 0.6473570929633247,
        "x1": 0.6240358041002859,
        "y1": 0.6624520427048808
      },
      "text": "be a finitely generated group, and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6306847466362847,
        "y0": 0.6473570929633247,
        "x1": 0.6491840337616166,
        "y1": 0.6624520427048808
      },
      "text": "M",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6575507369695925,
        "y0": 0.6473570929633247,
        "x1": 0.8497910842396854,
        "y1": 0.6624520427048808
      },
      "text": "a compact Riemannian",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000172534020118,
        "y0": 0.6655969908743193,
        "x1": 0.47994182312410644,
        "y1": 0.6806919406158756
      },
      "text": "manifold with the Riemannian measure",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4867043090022467,
        "y0": 0.6655969908743193,
        "x1": 0.49821023380055146,
        "y1": 0.6806919406158756
      },
      "text": "µ",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5046046138588899,
        "y0": 0.6655969908743193,
        "x1": 0.5513119167751737,
        "y1": 0.6806919406158756
      },
      "text": "and a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5577582066355188,
        "y0": 0.6655969908743193,
        "x1": 0.5728389266269659,
        "y1": 0.6806919406158756
      },
      "text": "G",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5728464562908496,
        "y0": 0.6655969908743193,
        "x1": 0.8496913535922181,
        "y1": 0.6806919406158756
      },
      "text": "-action by homeomorphisms. As-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15000167547487744,
        "y0": 0.6838368887853141,
        "x1": 0.23585642397014145,
        "y1": 0.6989318385268702
      },
      "text": "sume that",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24421410155452156,
        "y0": 0.6838368887853141,
        "x1": 0.2592948464786305,
        "y1": 0.6989318385268702
      },
      "text": "G",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.26796572816138176,
